;startSize=26;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=1;collapsible=0;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1307" width="370" height="226" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lge0" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=ERmandOne;startArrow=none;endFill=0;endSize=10;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.2;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="50" y="1351" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140" y="1351" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt0" value="exactly one (1)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="155" y="1341" width="190" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lge1" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=ERzeroToOne;startArrow=none;endFill=0;endSize=10;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.2;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="50" y="1381" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140" y="1381" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt1" value="zero or one (0..1)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="155" y="1371" width="190" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lge2" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=ERoneToMany;startArrow=none;endFill=0;endSize=10;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.2;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="50" y="1411" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140" y="1411" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt2" value="one or many (1..*)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="155" y="1401" width="190" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lge3" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startArrow=none;endFill=0;endSize=10;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1.2;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="50" y="1441" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="140" y="1441" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="lgt3" value="zero or many (0..*)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="155" y="1431" width="190" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lgn" value="PK primary key (underlined) · FK foreign key · UK unique&lt;br&gt;CASCADE / SET NULL / RESTRICT = ON DELETE rule of the FK&lt;br&gt;Header colours: blue accounts · green page · yellow endorsements&lt;br&gt;purple events · red admin review · grey lookups / framework" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1467" width="355" height="66" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="1307" width="2208" height="286" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notesh" value="Constraints, enums and delete rules" style="rounded=0;html=1;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="1307" width="2208" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notesb" value="• Enums (stored lowercase): users.role user|admin · users.status active|banned · request status (verification, endorsement, section invitation) pending|accepted|rejected · events.status pending|accepted|rejected · reports.status pending|resolved|dismissed · reports.target_type page|event|post · sections.type members|info.&lt;br&gt;• social_links.platform: whatsapp, facebook, linkedin, youtube, x, instagram, telegram, github, website · page_locations.floor: basement, ground, first, second, third, fourth, fifth_or_above.&lt;br&gt;• notifications.type (21): NEW_MESSAGE, ENDORSEMENT_REQUEST/ACCEPTED/REJECTED/DELETED, SECTION_INVITATION/DELETED, REMOVED_FROM_SECTION, INVITATION_ACCEPTED/REJECTED, MEMBER_LEFT, TRUST_MARK_REVOKED, ACCOUNT_BANNED/UNBANNED, VERIFICATION_ACCEPTED/REJECTED, EVENT_ACCEPTED/REJECTED/DELETED, CONTENT_DELETED, REPORT_DISMISSED. data = ids + names snapshot.&lt;br&gt;• Delete account (UC-U05) and delete reported page (UC-A18) = DELETE users row: every FK to users / pages is ON DELETE CASCADE, so page, location, links, gallery, sections, memberships, invitations, saved pages, conversations, messages, notifications, requests, endorsements given/received, reports sent, events and posts are removed in one statement.&lt;br&gt;• Admin FKs (verification_requests.reviewed_by, reports.handled_by) are ON DELETE SET NULL. Lookup FKs (city, job title, job category) are RESTRICT.&lt;br&gt;• Deleting a gallery image cascades to endorsement_request_images; deleting an event cascades to its posts and their reports; deleting a section cascades to its members and invitations.&lt;br&gt;• CHECKs: reports — exactly one of page_id / event_id / event_post_id is set and matches target_type · endorsements.rating 1..5 · events.end_date &amp;gt;= start_date · conversations.user_one_id &amp;lt; user_two_id · endorsement_requests.requester_id &amp;lt;&amp;gt; endorser_id · messages: body or attachment_path not null.&lt;br&gt;• Rules in the API (MySQL has no partial unique index): one pending verification request per user, one pending endorsement request per (requester, endorser), one pending invitation per (section, invitee), one pending report per (reporter, target), an event keeps at least one post.&lt;br&gt;• Derived, not stored: page average rating (AVG endorsements.rating via endorsement_requests.requester_id), job category of a page (via job_titles), unread counts (read_at IS NULL).&lt;br&gt;• events.city_id is copied from the owner page city at createEvent. pages.user_id is UNIQUE (user 1 : page 0..1, admins have no page). Banned users: their page and events are hidden by query (users.status).&lt;br&gt;• Laravel framework tables not drawn: sessions, cache, jobs, personal_access_tokens. User model uses RoutesNotifications (not Notifiable) because notifications is our own table." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="1333" width="2208" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
